Web-Bench
---------

The following test material reproduces short parts of the "survey" project of
Web-Bench (https://github.com/bytedance/web-bench), including code that a
model wrote while solving its tasks:

- tests/test_p264_related_code.py (the test fixture)
- tests/test_p259_syntax_check.py (the JavaScript of tasks 19 and 20)
- tests/test_p260_edit_mismatch.py and tests/fixtures/issue260_preview.js
  (preview.js)
- tests/test_p261_unknown_tool.py (the recorded tool calls)

