aider benchmark harness
-----------------------

scripts/official/polyglot.py and scripts/official/aider_runner.py follow the
benchmark harness of aider (https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider, commit
5dc9490b). The prompt texts in polyglot.py are copied from
benchmark/prompts.py, and the test commands and the way the second attempt is
given the test output follow benchmark/benchmark.py and cpp-test.sh. aider is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
